      "writtenOn": "2017-05-30T21:23:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Umm maybe. If you plan on disabling the EC uart tx during the bitbang enable process, should you check for servo in between the ec uart tx disconnect and bitbang enable?\n\nI am not sure how often this would be used or how bad it would be if we try to do bitbang while servo is attached.",
      "parentUuid": "ea62eaae_862c2b69",
      "revId": "7ce3c978fe25af3937c6cb077ee4d12ec9beaa17",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "37b2c19f_31c5c8fb",
